        "whatSpecial": "<p><br></p><p>At <strong>PT Esensi Solusi Buana (ESB)</strong>, you’re not just joining a company — you’re becoming part of Indonesia’s leading <strong>F&amp;B technology movement</strong>. Here, every idea counts and every role matters in shaping how restaurants, cafés, and cloud kitchens operate nationwide.</p><p><br></p><p>We value <strong>Honesty, Empathy, and Agility</strong>, creating a culture where innovation thrives, people grow, and collaboration drives real impact.</p><p><br></p><p>Join a workplace that’s <strong>dynamic, purpose-driven, and full of opportunities to grow</strong> — both personally and professionally.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>#GrowingWithESB</strong></p>",
